<title>USA: UAL's United launches long-range 777 jet.</title>
<headline>UAL's United launches long-range 777 jet.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>UAL Corp said its United Airlines is introducing the first of its new, long-range 777 aircraft from Boeing Co with service from San Francisco International Airport to London's Heathrow Airport.</p>
<p>The daily service is scheduled to begin April 5, with a second daily flight starting April 10. The new Boeing 777s will replace smaller Boeing 767 jets, which currently operate both daily flights to London.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
